description=Combined thermal + gaming module for smooth FPS on Xiaomi Mi 9 (cepheus/sm8150). IN-GAME: releases userspace thermal throttling (pauses mi_thermald + resets cooling & CPU clamp) and raises the GPU floor. OUTSIDE games, thermal runs normally. Also applies I/O deadline and VM tuning. Safe alongside Encore Tweaks (Encore manages CPU governor/cpufreq).
